      "form_guide": "",
      "comment": "MISS PIPER (2) is a promising type who notched her 3rd career success when too good (20.06) at this track last time. Strike rate this course strong having won three of six tries. Speedy beginner who should be prominent early on from an inside box. Well placed and will be tough to beat. RICO CAPPUCCINO (8) has been mixing form lately, hitting the frame two back before finishing sixth (20.60) at this track in a TG1-4W. Safe beginner but wide box to overcome and will need some luck. Well placed here and can atone this time. LIFE OF LUXURY (5) turned in a modest effort most recently when fifth at this track over 342m behind Juno Usko (20.31) in a Grade 6. Was in the money the start prior. Can figure in the finish. ROCK ON BUB (1) is likely to have admirers.",
